{"id":"khod","lemma":"ход","pos":"noun","rank":940,"glosses":["motion, movement, travel, progress, locomotion, headway","course, path, way, run","speed, rate, gait, pace"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/80/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%B4.ogg/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BE%D0%B4.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"хода"},"examples":[{"text":"Теперь мой ход.","en":"Now it's my turn.","words":[{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Наконец-то мой ход.","en":"It's finally my turn.","words":[{"g":"at last, finally"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Они не дадут этому хода.","en":"They won't let this pass.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},null,null]},{"text":"Я забыл, чей ход.","en":"I forgot whose turn it was.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to forget","l":"забыть"},{"g":"whose"},null]},{"text":"Этот человек изменил ход истории.","en":"This man changed the course of history.","words":[{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"person"},{"g":"to change","l":"изменить"},null,{"g":"history","l":"история"}]}]}